== bold: a breakthrough in your work / B
base: keep it secret until you have worked out how to profit from it
likelier_if: has [striking a deal] +10; has [contact in the trade] +5
- B | put your savings into a firm built round the find, before anyone can copy it | v: achievement, power | act: put their savings into a firm built round the find | chance: 30 | requires: savings; good credit | title: founder of a firm | takes_if_fails: savings
works: {N} signs the papers for a small firm of {Ns} own, and the first order comes in within a month.
works: The firm is small, but it is {Ns}, and the find is its whole stock.
